    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Three inmates. One human warden. No intimacy allowed\u2026 or is it?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337930/extras/8e44887a29f6df6f00c33010ad92db3e.avif?t=1747716259\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The worlds of humans and furries have merged, and now everyone must learn how to coexist. You play as the first, and only, human warden in a special prison for furry convicts. Your duty is to maintain order, manage the prison, and most importantly, guide three unique furry girls back onto the right path. Each conversation reveals more about who they are, what they've done, and why.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this game, you'll experience three deep and emotional storylines, brought to life through detailed dialogue. Talk to the girls, build trust, raise their sympathy, and uncover the truth behind their actions. But be warned: prison rules strictly forbid any intimate or sexual relationships between wardens and inmates. Will you maintain your professionalism, or give in to forbidden desires?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337930/extras/8d49e016b84e493ed54a9ea4ea7f35fb.avif?t=1747716259\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours of deep, emotionally driven conversations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18+ content: hundreds of erotic scenes and sexual dialogues with the furry girls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erotic puzzle games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prison management with mini-games and daily responsibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong storytelling, adult themes, and impactful choices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337930/extras/ae6fd23141f937641ad7e2bc5baba313.avif?t=1747716259\" width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook some food, clean up the place, or blow off steam with a bit of shooting practice, each mini-game is a fun part of your everyday prison life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337930/extras/bffa3239520590e30ffe67310690b5ca.avif?t=1747716259\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the girls whose hearts you're about to discover:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>LISA</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Lisa</strong></u> is kind, light-hearted, and a hopeless romantic. Behind her cheerful smile hides a quiet loneliness, waiting for someone to truly see her.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337930/extras/964adaa12fad7c8f48644140719f293b.avif?t=1747716259\" data-has-big width=800 height=410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>TRISHA</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Trisha</strong></u> is strong-willed and fearless, always pushing forward with fierce ambition. But even the boldest warriors carry silent sorrows.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337930/extras/cb6a8b6f1971ca4ff1388f5cb57b82c7.avif?t=1747716259\" data-has-big width=800 height=410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FELICITY</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Felicity</strong></u> is graceful and elegant, with a soft voice and gentle spirit. She hides behind shy glances and layers of luxury, unsure if she\u2019s ever truly enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337930/extras/ae82634764dc00f6ff08128345851a86.avif?t=1747716259\" data-has-big width=800 height=410 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
